Section 4. Form and Contents of the Application — The
application for home solicitation sales shall be in the form
prescribed by the Department and shall contain the following
information and documents:

4.1. Business name and address of the applicant;

4.2. The product to be sold through home solicitations or a
general description thereof;

4.3. The manner by which such home solicitation shall be
conducted;

4.4. The business name and address of its agents, where
registration of the same is being applied for;

4.5. The scope and duration of authority granted to such
agents;

4.6. A specimen of the authorization given to such agents; and

4.7. A specimen of the identification given to such agents.

